title: "Burmese-to-Ukrainian Phonetic-Graphemic Correspondence System"
type: software
version: 0.2.2
date-released: 2026-10-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/ClippyFirst/Burmese-Ukrainian-Phonetic-System-"
url: "https://github.com/ClippyFirst/Burmese-Ukrainian-Phonetic-System-"
